<h1>Welcome to the Help Page!</h1>
<h2>How to play</h2>
<p>Congratulations! You have opened your very own shop in the zombie apocalypse! Your 
    goal is to explore and find items to sell in your shop, but beware! Sometimes you
    will get lucky and find a great item to sell, other times you may encounter some
    zombies you will have to fignt! Keep a close eye on your HP. If it reaches 0 the game is over.
    Whenever you are done exploring you can go to your store and sell to other survivors. 
    Try and last as long as you can. </p>
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<ul>
    <li> Make sure you only start a new game if you want to delete your 
        previous progress!
    </li>
    <li>You can view your characters HP, Gold and inventory on the game homepage.</li>

</ul>